sequenceDiagram
    actor H as Threat hunter
    participant C as Command API
    participant RC as Sigma compiler
    participant CP as Coverage planner
    participant X as Executor
    participant IX as Index (Bloom + BM25)
    participant A as Archive
    participant D as DuckDB
    participant B as Event bus
    H->>C: SubmitRule(sigma, time range)
    C->>RC: compile (ECS pipeline)
    RC-->>CP: fields, grain, window
    CP-->>C: plan (tier, coverage %, est. bytes, est. cost)
    C-->>H: plan preview (dry run)
    H->>C: ApproveRun [if estimate above threshold]
    C->>X: ExecuteRule
    X->>D: Tier 1/2 SQL at pinned snapshots
    alt Tier 3 needed
        X->>IX: bloom prune, then anchor term lookup
        IX-->>X: doc addresses (file, row group)
        X->>A: restore matching row groups only
        X->>D: evaluate predicate on restored rows
    end
    X->>B: RuleEvaluated (tiers, coverage, bytes, cost)
    B-->>H: results via Query API read model
